OL,3,CLifeboat called to severely crashed
OL,4,Cvehicle at Mull of Galloway cliff foot
OL,6,FLifeboat volunteers were called out
OL,7,Fyesterday afternoon (Saturday 25th
OL,8,FJuly 2026) following reports of a
OL,9,Fseverely crashed vehicle at the foot
OL,10,Fof cliffs near the Mull of Galloway.
OL,12,FRNLI crews from Stranraer and
OL,13,FPortpatrick attended and searched the
OL,14,Fshoreline. Enquiries revealed the
OL,15,Fvehicle had been there for some time
OL,16,Fand no-one was in distress or danger.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/5
