OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785417510
OL,3,CLifeboat called to severely crashed
OL,4,Cvehicle at Mull of Galloway cliff foot
OL,6,FStranraer RNLI Lifeboat received the
OL,7,Fcall at 13.26 and said, "With concerns
OL,8,Ffor the welfare of any occupants,
OL,9,Fevery minute counted" so they "made
OL,10,Fbest speed to the scene."
OL,12,FOn arrival, the reported casualty
OL,13,Fvehicle was quickly located, and both
OL,14,Flifeboats thoroughly searched the
OL,15,Fsurrounding shoreline and sea area
OL,16,Fwhile Police Scotland made enquiries
OL,17,Fashore.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,330,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785417510
OL,3,CLifeboat called to severely crashed
OL,4,Cvehicle at Mull of Galloway cliff foot
OL,6,FHowever, this confirmed the vehicle
OL,7,Fhad been at the location for some time
OL,8,Fand no-one was in distress or danger.
OL,9,FBoth lifeboats were stood down.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Stranraer RNLI
OL,12,FLifeboat said, "While today's call had
OL,13,Fa positive outcome, it serves as a
OL,14,Freminder that reports like these are
OL,15,Falways treated seriously. Our
OL,16,Fvolunteer crews are ready to respond
OL,17,Fat a moment's notice."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/5
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,330,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785417510
OL,3,CLifeboat called to severely crashed
OL,4,Cvehicle at Mull of Galloway cliff foot
OL,6,FLifeboat Operations Manager Antony
OL,7,FSimpson added, "Every launch is
OL,8,Ftreated as a genuine emergency until
OL,9,Fwe're able to establish otherwise.
OL,11,FWhile this incident thankfully had a
OL,12,Fpositive outcome, the initial
OL,13,Finformation suggested there could have
OL,14,Fbeen people in immediate danger, so
OL,15,Four volunteer crew responded without
OL,16,Fhesitation."
OL,18,FHe went on to thank volunteer crew
OL,19,Fmembers, HM Coastguard, Portpatrick
OL,20,FRNLI and Police Scotland for their
OL,21,F"excellent teamwork".
OL,26,@oD@POU
